Remove the 4 rubber adhesive feet:

{{:media:sitecom:sitecomremovefeet.jpg?400|}}

Unscrew the screws behind.
Then pull on the 2 teeth on the long side:

{{:media:sitecom:sitecomlongside1.jpg?400|}}

{{:media:sitecom:sitecomlongside2.jpg?400|}}

